Because we still haven't--

240
00:10:28.252 --> 00:10:30.004
<i>I'm afraid there's no time to discuss</i>

241
00:10:30.004 --> 00:10:32.798
<i>the many presents I bought.
some of which are large.</i>

242
00:10:32.798 --> 00:10:35.051
<i>Soldier. you are ordered
to report for duty.</i>

243
00:10:35.051 --> 00:10:36.218
(Amy gasps)

244
00:10:36.218 --> 00:10:39.513
- Is it war?
<i>- I hope so. but we're not sure.</i>

245
00:10:39.513 --> 00:10:42.308
<i>All we know is that DOOP
has lost radio contact</i>

246
00:10:42.308 --> 00:10:44.810
<i>with a remote outpost in Ursa Major.</i>

247
00:10:44.810 --> 00:10:45.895
<i>Over and under.</i>

248
00:10:45.895 --> 00:10:46.979
- (beep)
- (clattering)

249
00:10:46.979 --> 00:10:48.314
(groans)

250
